@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added the ``sqlite3`` minion data cache backend (:mod:`salt.cache.sqlite3_cache <salt.cache.sqlite3_cache>`), a single-file, on-disk cache built entirely on the Python standard library. It lets a master keep cached grains, mine data, job returns, and other minion data durable across restarts without installing or operating a separate database service. Enable with ``cache: sqlite3`` on the master; existing deployments are unaffected since ``localfs`` remains the default.
